{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured a persistent NetworkManager-managed dnsmasq cache on node1. System applications use 127.0.0.1:53 while the DHCP-provided upstream 10.100.156.1 remains preserved. External A/AAAA and HTTPS resolution work, caching was proven at packet level, and the configuration recovered after the mandatory node restart.","actions_performed":["Installed dnsmasq and DNS diagnostic utilities.","Configured NetworkManager to manage dnsmasq with a 1,000-entry cache.","Verified local resolver listening, application resolution, external connectivity, and caching.","Safely restarted node1 exactly once and verified its changed boot identity and complete recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Local caching DNS resolver configured for system applications","command_ids":["cmd-17327ae6876b4988","cmd-5afdcfb1ec0e41c4","cmd-82abecbd25ae4a4e"],"summary":"Configuration is valid and persistent; /etc/resolv.conf points to 127.0.0.1, dnsmasq listens on port 53, and NetworkManager is enabled and active."},{"requirement":"Normal external name resolution preserved","command_ids":["cmd-898ed62ec65b4010","cmd-82abecbd25ae4a4e"],"summary":"The original upstream remains 10.100.156.1; application, HTTPS, A, and AAAA lookups succeed through the local resolver."},{"requirement":"Resolver performs local caching","command_ids":["cmd-593bdf8a2b7d4ca4","cmd-9830443f52034d04","cmd-32e98699c5a64c22"],"summary":"Two identical queries after cache clearing generated only one upstream packet. Runtime statistics confirm a 1,000-entry cache and zero upstream failures, including after restart."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-47749744c9ea4c90","cmd-74ceaa69af65402d","cmd-cca505ba048f48df","cmd-d962e15058c74e0a","cmd-32e98699c5a64c22"],"summary":"Healthy baseline used boot ID 03408ac4-bfe4-4151-98bd-1966b0a205af; reboot acknowledgement returned before disconnect; execution resumed with boot ID c662a81d-532a-4282-8dab-2b60c37d80c2; resolver configuration, listener, upstream forwarding, external resolution, and caching recovered."}]}
